# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# No data file is ever committed to this repository.
#
# The Drink Less trial data are public but belong to the trial, not to us: they are
# obtained from https://osf.io/w3szp and are not redistributed here. Every other data
# file in this repository is an output that the code regenerates. So the rule is to
# ignore data files by extension, everywhere, and to whitelist the one exception below
# explicitly. If a new file has to be committed, add it here by name and say why.
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.rds
*.RDS
*.rda
*.RData
*.csv
*.tsv
*.xls
*.xlsx
*.dta
*.sav
*.sas7bdat
*.feather
*.parquet
dataset/

# The one exception: 50 simulated participants generated by misc/toy_example/dgm.R,
# used by the worked example. It contains no trial data.
!misc/toy_example/toy_data.RDS

# generated by regenerate_paper_figures.R
Application/DrinkLess/Sample Size Calculator/figures/
Rplots.pdf

# generated by simulation/consistency_sim/run_consistency_sim.R
simulation/consistency_sim/results/
